{"version":1,"key":"article:80","content":{"id":80,"title":"URLPattern 使用介绍","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在前端开发中，URL 匹配是一个极其常见的需求。无论是前端路由（React Router、Vue Router）、Service Worker 中的请求拦截，还是服务端框架的路由分发，我们都需要判断一个 URL 是否符合某种模式，并从中提取参数。长久以来，开发者要么依赖 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"path-to-regexp"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这类第三方库，要么手写正则表达式来完成这项工作。前者增加了包体积和依赖管理成本，后者则容易出错且可读性差。试想一下，当你需要匹配 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/users/123/posts/456","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这样的嵌套路径并提取其中的 ID 时，手写正则大概会变成 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/\\/users\\/(\\d+)\\/posts\\/(\\d+)/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不仅难以阅读，参数还只能通过数组下标访问，稍有修改就可能全盘出错。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 正是为了解决这个问题而诞生的 Web API。它将 URL 模式匹配提升为浏览器原生能力，提供了声明式的、结构化的匹配语法，让我们可以像描述 URL 的形状一样去匹配它。本文将从基础用法讲起，逐步深入到构造方式、匹配方法、模式语法，最后通过几个实战场景展示它的真正威力。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"快速上手"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在深入 API 细节之前，我们先通过一个示例直观感受 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能做到什么。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最基础的用法是路径匹配与参数提取。假设我们有一个用户详情页的 URL，想从中提取用户 ID："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern('https://www.example.com/users/:id')\n\nconst res = pattern.exec('https://www.example.com/users/1')\nconsole.log(res.pathname.groups.id) // -> '1'","uuid":"bc2d24f3-ff7b-4878-9dc8-54264c65c78c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"就这么简单。"},{"type":"formatted","text":":id","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会自动作为命名参数被捕获到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"groups","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象中，无需手写任何正则。对比前面提到的正则方案，代码意图一目了然。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"了解了基本效果后，接下来我们逐步看看 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的构造方式、匹配方法和模式语法。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"构造函数"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，第一步是构造一个模式实例。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供了多种构造方式，以适应不同的使用场景："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"new URLPattern(input)\nnew URLPattern(input, baseURL)\nnew URLPattern(input, options)\nnew URLPattern(input, baseURL, options)","uuid":"76e14387-d3ae-4fba-aa99-f9c4904853d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"字符串形式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最直接的方式是传入完整的 URL 模式字符串："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"new URLPattern('https://example.com/users/:id')","uuid":"57faa351-5bd0-4809-bd32-7f6bd273af84","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种方式适合模式相对固定、URL 各部分都需要精确匹配的场景。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对象形式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当你只关心 URL 的某个部分时，可以传入一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPatternInit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，分别指定各组成部分的匹配模式："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"interface URLPatternInit {\n  protocol?: string;    // 协议模式，如 'https'、'http*'\n  username?: string;    // 用户名模式\n  password?: string;    // 密码模式\n  hostname?: string;    // 主机名模式，如 '*.example.com'\n  port?: string;        // 端口模式，如 '80'、'*'\n  pathname?: string;    // 路径模式，如 '/users/:id'\n  search?: string;      // 查询字符串模式（不含 ?）\n  hash?: string;        // 哈希模式（不含 #）\n  baseURL?: string;     // 基础 URL，用于解析相对路径\n}","uuid":"ff16e397-719b-4aea-b673-43404dbd9964","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如在 Service Worker 中，你可能只关心路径而不在乎协议和域名："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"new URLPattern({ pathname: '/api/users/:id' })","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"be90e1fc-0e38-4314-aaee-c9eb3951d1c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"或者需要同时约束协议和主机名："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"new URLPattern({\n  protocol: 'https',\n  hostname: '*.example.com',\n  pathname: '/users/:id',\n})","uuid":"cda15b39-a9b5-41ce-a2c9-09f2e1fc9f83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相对路径与 baseURL"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"input","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是相对路径时，需要提供 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"baseURL","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为第二个参数来补全完整地址："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"new URLPattern('/users/:id', 'https://example.com')","uuid":"da5bde83-24a5-4ad1-a14e-d5c4f2726f85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果传入了相对路径但没有提供 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"baseURL","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，会抛出 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"TypeError","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"// Uncaught TypeError: Failed to construct 'URLPattern': \n// Relative constructor string '/users/:id' must have a base URL passed as the second argument.\nnew URLPattern('/users/:id')","uuid":"579936d3-3bf0-46db-b52f-06ed789f07f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"options 配置"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后，还可以传入可选的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"options","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数来控制匹配行为："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"interface URLPatternOptions {\n  ignoreCase?: boolean;  // 是否忽略大小写，默认 false\n}","uuid":"47c9958c-a159-47a8-be20-b778bd3464c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"// 忽略大小写匹配\nconst pattern = new URLPattern('/users/:id', 'https://example.com', { ignoreCase: true })\npattern.test('https://example.com/Users/123') // true","uuid":"c341b651-7029-4300-9f6f-665a3e385313","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实例方法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"构造出模式实例后，我们需要用它来匹配实际的 URL。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供了两个方法："},{"type":"formatted","text":"test","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"exec","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。它们的关系类似正则表达式的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"RegExp.prototype.test","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"RegExp.prototype.exec","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，前者只返回布尔值，后者还会返回详细的匹配结果。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"test"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"test ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"用于快速判断一个 URL 是否符合模式，返回"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":" true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"pattern.test(input)\npattern.test(input, baseURL)","uuid":"73b272e5-bca0-4aaf-8d39-07f5850856e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern('/users/:id', 'https://example.com');\n\n// 使用完整 URL 字符串测试\npattern.test('https://example.com/users/123');     // true\npattern.test('https://example.com/users/abc');     // true\npattern.test('https://example.com/posts/123');     // false\npattern.test('https://other.com/users/123');       // false\n\n// 使用相对路径 + baseURL\npattern.test('/users/789', 'https://example.com'); // true","uuid":"1bb435f1-4f97-4c4d-b5c4-6478cc4f1e9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"适合用在条件分支中，比如判断请求是否命中某个路由。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"exec"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当不仅需要知道是否匹配，还需要提取参数时，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"exec","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"pattern.exec(input)\npattern.exec(input, baseURL)","uuid":"d9e54a08-b4eb-4276-89ff-0139dfff434d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"exec ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配成功时返回一个"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":" URLPatternResult"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，失败时返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。返回结果包含 URL 每个组成部分的匹配详情："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"interface URLPatternResult {\n  inputs: (string | URLPatternInit)[];   // 原始输入\n\n  // 各 URL 组件的匹配结果\n  protocol: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  username: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  password: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  hostname: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  port: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  pathname: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  search: URLPatternComponentResult;\n  hash: URLPatternComponentResult;\n}\n\ninterface URLPatternComponentResult {\n  input: string;                              // 该组件的原始输入值\n  groups: Record<string, string | undefined>; // 捕获的命名组\n}","uuid":"3ff5bf79-ea6a-41b6-9bdc-0ff70328a588","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是一个完整示例，展示如何从 URL 中同时提取多个路径参数："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern(\n  '/users/:userId/posts/:postId',\n  'https://example.com'\n);\n\nconst result = pattern.exec('https://example.com/users/123/posts/456');\n\nif (result) {\n  const { userId, postId } = result.pathname.groups;\n  console.log(userId); // '123'\n  console.log(postId); // '456'\n}","uuid":"ef59b9ed-567e-4baf-a59d-fe13f2f29467","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"返回对象的完整结构如下，通常我们只需要关注 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pathname.groups","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"{\n  \"inputs\": [\"https://example.com/users/123/posts/456\"],\n  \"pathname\": {\n    \"input\": \"/users/123/posts/456\",\n    \"groups\": { \"userId\": \"123\", \"postId\": \"456\" }\n  },\n  \"hostname\": { \"input\": \"example.com\", \"groups\": {} },\n  \"protocol\": { \"input\": \"https\", \"groups\": {} },\n  \"port\":     { \"input\": \"\", \"groups\": {} },\n  \"search\":   { \"input\": \"\", \"groups\": { \"0\": \"\" } },\n  \"hash\":     { \"input\": \"\", \"groups\": { \"0\": \"\" } },\n  \"username\": { \"input\": \"\", \"groups\": { \"0\": \"\" } },\n  \"password\": { \"input\": \"\", \"groups\": { \"0\": \"\" } }\n}","uuid":"23fb2fde-3464-4e9b-b9fd-ecc9e453b818","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实例属性"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了匹配方法，每个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例上还暴露了一组只读属性，反映构造时传入（或推导出）的模式字符串。这在调试、日志记录或序列化模式时非常有用："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类型"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例值"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"protocol","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"协议模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'https'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"'http*'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"username","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户名模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'*'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"password","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密码模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'*'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"hostname","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主机名模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'example.com'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"'*.example.com'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"port","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"端口模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"''","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"'8080'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"'*'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pathname","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"路径模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'/users/:id'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"search","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"查询字符串模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'*'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"'q=:query'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"hash","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"哈希模式"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"'*'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"':section'","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"hasRegExpGroups","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"boolean","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是否包含正则表达式组"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern('/users/:id', 'https://example.com');\n\nconsole.log(pattern.protocol);  // 'https'\nconsole.log(pattern.hostname);  // 'example.com'\nconsole.log(pattern.pathname);  // '/users/:id'\nconsole.log(pattern.port);      // ''\nconsole.log(pattern.search);    // '*'\nconsole.log(pattern.hash);      // '*'","uuid":"72378e0b-8b90-48d0-bfa9-274986f168e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意未显式指定的部分（如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"search","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"hash","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"'*'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即匹配任意值。这意味着 URL 后面带不带查询参数、有没有 hash，都不会影响匹配结果。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模式语法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前面我们已经用到了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":name","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这样的命名参数，但 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的模式语法远不止于此。它源自 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"path-to-regexp","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 库的语法设计，如果你用过 Express 或早期的 React Router，会感到非常熟悉。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面按照从基础到进阶的顺序逐一介绍。整体来说，模式语法可以分为三个层次：基础匹配（命名参数、通配符）、灵活控制（可选、重复）、精确约束（正则、分组）。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"命名参数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":name","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常用的语法，用来匹配单个路径段（不含 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）并将其捕获为命名参数："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern('/users/:userId/posts/:postId', baseURL);\n\n// ✓ 匹配\npattern.exec('.../users/123/posts/456');\n// pathname.groups = { userId: '123', postId: '456' }\n\n// ✗ 不匹配（缺少段）\npattern.test('.../users/123');           // false\npattern.test('.../users/123/posts');     // false","uuid":"928fb3c9-8ce5-44cb-9b1f-b39b1a87a3f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"命名参数默认只匹配到下一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为止，这保证了路径结构的严格性。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通配符 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"*","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配任意字符（包含 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"），适合需要捕获剩余路径的场景："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern('/api/*', baseURL);\n\npattern.exec('.../api/users/123/posts');\n// pathname.groups = { '0': 'users/123/posts' }\n\npattern.test('.../api/');         // true（匹配空字符串）\npattern.test('.../api/anything'); // true","uuid":"69e7803b-ece4-49b9-b83d-eabcca6627c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于通配符没有命名，捕获结果存放在数字索引 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"'0'","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中。通配符在 Service Worker 的请求拦截中尤为常见，比如拦截所有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/api/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开头的请求。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可选参数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":name?","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参数可以存在也可以不存在，适合有默认行为的路由（如列表页同时兼做详情页入口）："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const pattern = new URLPattern('/users/:id?', baseURL);\n\npattern.test('.../users');       // true, groups.id = undefined\npattern.test('.../users/');      // true, groups.id = undefined\npattern.test('.../users/123');   // true, groups.id = '123'\npattern.test('.../users/123/x'); // false（多余的段）","uuid":"9361a1da-3206-4a75-828c-cc94ae5d8404","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"典型场景："},{"type":"formatted","text":"/lang/:locale?/docs","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以让语言前缀变为可选，同时支持 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/docs","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/en/docs","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复参数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":name+","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":name*","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当需要匹配多级路径时，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"+","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（一个或多个）或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"*","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（零个或多个）："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"// :path+ 匹配一个或多个段\nconst patternPlus = new URLPattern('/files/:path+', baseURL);\npatternPlus.test('.../files/a');       // true, path = 'a'\npatternPlus.test('.../files/a/b/c');   // true, path = 'a/b/c'\npatternPlus.test('.../files');         // false（至少需要一个）\n\n// :path* 匹配零个或多个段\nconst patternStar = new URLPattern('/docs/:path*', baseURL);\npatternStar.test('.../docs');          // true, path = undefined\npatternStar.test('.../docs/a/b');      // true, path = 'a/b'","uuid":"414e9c93-f251-49fd-9fb4-bd19452f09d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"典型的应用场景是文件系统路径或面包屑导航，比如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/docs/:path+","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以匹配任意深度的文档路径。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正则约束 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":name(regexp)","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有时命名参数需要限制格式，比如只允许数字 ID，这时可以在参数后附加正则："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"// 只匹配数字 ID\nconst pattern = new URLPattern('/users/:id(\\\\d+)', baseURL);\n\npattern.test('.../users/123');    // true\npattern.test('.../users/456789'); // true\npattern.test('.../users/abc');    // false\npattern.test('.../users/12ab');   // false\n\n// 匹配特定日期格式\nconst datePattern = new URLPattern('/posts/:date(\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{2})', baseURL);\ndatePattern.test('.../posts/2024-01-15'); // true\ndatePattern.test('.../posts/2024-1-5');   // false","uuid":"9538fcaf-d74b-41c9-9445-217549674338","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正则约束让你可以在模式层面就完成输入校验，而不必在匹配成功后再手动检查参数格式。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"{...}","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分组用于将多个部分组合在一起，常与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"?","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 配合实现可选的路径片段："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"// 可选的版本前缀\nconst pattern = new URLPattern('/api{/v:version}?/users', baseURL);\n\npattern.test('.../api/users');      // true, version = undefined\npattern.test('.../api/v1/users');   // true, version = '1'\npattern.test('.../api/v2/users');   // true, version = '2'","uuid":"1ece87f8-4d6f-43cb-bac8-35429d885f13","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"{/v:version}","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":version","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 视为一个整体，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"?","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 让这个整体变为可选。分组最大的价值是让你能够「原子化」地控制路径片段的可选性，而不仅仅是单个参数。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配其他 URL 组件"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模式语法不仅可以用在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pathname","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上，也可以用来匹配 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"hostname","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"search","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等部分："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"// 匹配子域名\nconst pattern = new URLPattern({\n  hostname: ':subdomain.example.com',\n  pathname: '/*'\n});\n\npattern.exec('https://api.example.com/users');\n// hostname.groups = { subdomain: 'api' }\n\n// 匹配任意子域名\nconst wildcardPattern = new URLPattern({\n  hostname: '*.example.com'\n});","uuid":"669555cf-c62b-4f7e-b49d-ffe52abc7221","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个能力在多租户系统中特别有用，比如根据子域名分发到不同的租户服务。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"语法速查表"}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"语法"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"名称"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配示例"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":":name","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"命名参数"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配单个路径段（不含 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/users/:id","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/users/123","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"*","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通配符"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配任意字符（含 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/api/*","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/api/a/b/c","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":":name?","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可选参数"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参数可存在可不存在"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/users/:id?","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/users","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/users/123","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":":name+","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个或多个"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配一个或多个路径段"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/files/:path+","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/files/a/b","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":":name*","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"零个或多个"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匹配零个或多个路径段"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/files/:path*","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/files","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"/files/a/b","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":":name(regexp)","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正则约束"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用正则限制匹配内容"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/users/:id(\\\\d+)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → 只匹配数字"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(regexp)","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匿名正则组"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不命名的正则捕获组"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/(\\\\d+).jpg","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"{...}","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分组"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将多个部分组合（不捕获）"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/api{/v:version}?/users","code":true}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\\\x","code":true}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"转义"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"转义特殊字符"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"/path\\\\*","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" → 匹配字面量 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"*","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实战应用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"了解了 API 和语法之后，让我们看看 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在真实场景中如何发挥作用。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"简易前端路由系统"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以非常自然地实现一个声明式的路由匹配器："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const routes = [\n  { pattern: new URLPattern({ pathname: '/' }), component: 'Home' },\n  { pattern: new URLPattern({ pathname: '/users' }), component: 'UserList' },\n  { pattern: new URLPattern({ pathname: '/users/:id' }), component: 'UserDetail' },\n  { pattern: new URLPattern({ pathname: '/posts/:slug' }), component: 'PostDetail' },\n];\n\nfunction matchRoute(url) {\n  for (const route of routes) {\n    const match = route.pattern.exec(url);\n    if (match) {\n      return { component: route.component, params: match.pathname.groups };\n    }\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n\n// 使用\nconst result = matchRoute('https://myapp.com/users/42');\n// { component: 'UserDetail', params: { id: '42' } }","uuid":"a71c71c8-a65a-4946-bcc9-e817e35f100d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个路由规则都是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例，匹配逻辑清晰且声明式，比起正则拼接或手动分割路径要直观得多。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Service Worker 请求拦截"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Service Worker 中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 让请求匹配变得极为优雅："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const API_PATTERN = new URLPattern({ pathname: '/api/:version/:resource+' });\nconst STATIC_PATTERN = new URLPattern({ pathname: '/static/*' });\n\nself.addEventListener('fetch', (event) => {\n  const url = event.request.url;\n\n  if (STATIC_PATTERN.test(url)) {\n    // 静态资源走缓存优先策略\n    event.respondWith(caches.match(event.request).then(\n      cached => cached || fetch(event.request)\n    ));\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const apiMatch = API_PATTERN.exec(url);\n  if (apiMatch) {\n    const { version, resource } = apiMatch.pathname.groups;\n    // 根据 API 版本和资源类型决定缓存策略\n    event.respondWith(handleApiRequest(event.request, version, resource));\n    return;\n  }\n});","uuid":"d215fc4d-b4ae-4e21-aa57-35080fa1f56e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务端路由分发"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Node.js（24.0+）、Deno 或 Cloudflare Workers 中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 已经是原生可用的，非常适合构建轻量路由："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const routes = [\n  {\n    pattern: new URLPattern({ pathname: '/api/users/:id' }),\n    handler: (req, match) => {\n      const { id } = match.pathname.groups;\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ userId: id }), {\n        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }\n      });\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    pattern: new URLPattern({ pathname: '/api/posts/:slug' }),\n    handler: (req, match) => {\n      const { slug } = match.pathname.groups;\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ post: slug }));\n    }\n  }\n];\n\n// 请求处理\nfunction handleRequest(request) {\n  for (const route of routes) {\n    const match = route.pattern.exec(request.url);\n    if (match) {\n      return route.handler(request, match);\n    }\n  }\n  return new Response('Not Found', { status: 404 });\n}","uuid":"92add848-bf85-469e-afc6-11a14c28c2a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无需引入任何路由框架，几十行代码就能搭建一个功能完备的路由系统。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器兼容性"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"URLPattern","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 已被所有主流浏览器支持，包括 Chrome 95+、Edge 95+、Firefox 136+、Safari 18.2+，同时 Node.js、Deno、Cloudflare Workers 等服务端运行时也已原生实现。可以放心在生产环境中使用。对于仍需兼容旧浏览器的场景，社区也提供了 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/kenchris/urlpattern-polyfill","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"urlpattern-polyfill"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为降级方案。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_eba9f25a-9e8b-40ce-b850-08250bf12c09.webp","alt":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_eba9f25a-9e8b-40ce-b850-08250bf12c09.webp","width":511}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C%3A%5CUsers%5Cpc%5CDesktop%5Cimages%5Cwallhaven-d85ewm_14753025-44b9-44ac-bbd1-0c80c91b0c1a.webp","createTime":1779806911092,"updateTime":1779845161463},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1779845161463}}